      "content": "It is not okay to feel erased or dead to a world you feel you no longer fit into; this sense of permanent isolation is a sign you are in deep distress and deserve compassionate support. You do not know the end of the \"real\" you that you feel is dead because current pain often shadows us until we find help to find the words to understand it. Please consider talking to a counselor or crisis support today, as a safe guide can help you understand that you still exist and people want to support you.",
      "source": "target",
